Campaign Forge: Fantasy d20 Remaster (ORC) data pack
=====================================================

Compatible with Pathfinder Second Edition (Remaster). Not affiliated with or endorsed by Paizo Inc. Pathfinder is a trademark of Paizo Inc.

This module contains rules content released under the ORC License from four
books: Player Core, Player Core 2, GM Core and Monster Core. Only entries the
source marks as ORC-licensed, remastered and from one of those books are
included (see scripts/generated/conversion-notes.txt for every exclusion).


