3. Reserved Material
--------------------

None of the publishers' Reserved Material is used: no trademarks, and none of
the setting's proper nouns (deities, places, planes of its cosmology,
organizations, named characters, peoples, events). The converter drops every
entry whose name is Reserved Material, removes the sentences that name it, and
rewrites the setting's planes and underground realm to generic phrases; the
list it uses is scripts/source/reserved.ts and the tests check nothing on it
remains. Images, maps and art are not included.

The converted rules text and statistics remain Licensed Material under the ORC
License. Everything marked "Original" in the app (tables, generators,
templates, play advice, the calendar, the demo campaign) was written for
Campaign Forge and is not part of the books.

