4. Changes made
---------------

The ORC content was taken from the JSON structuring of the Foundry VTT pf2e
system (below) and reorganised into Campaign Forge's data pack format: HTML
turned into Markdown, Foundry's inline links and rolls into the plain text a
book prints ("DC 20 basic Reflex", "2d6 fire", "30-foot cone"), creature stat
blocks mapped onto a sheet with the multiple attack penalty written out,
conditions and actions also given as rule cards cited by section, Foundry
automation, images and usage notes dropped, and Reserved Material removed as
described above.


